{
  "name": "dsh-ui-tweaks",
  "version": "0.7.5",
  "author": "MeganeOnly",
  "description": "DSH 外观设计微调合集（v0.7.5：1) hide-trajectory-tab 扩展——同时隐藏每个工具调用 row 内的 Inspect 按钮（DSH 源码 dsh-client-ui-tool 渲染 <button class=\"*_inspectButton\">，点击进轨迹视图），CSS 用 [class*=_inspectButton] substring 命中，不依赖 DSH 升级 hash；2) Tweak row 描述文字从始终渲染的 <p> 收进 HTML title 属性——鼠标悬停时弹出浏览器原生 tooltip，row 默认加 cursor:help 提示可悬看。旧 .DTPD_itemDesc 规则移除。状态由 client half 用 localStorage 自管。当前包含 conversation-shift、conversation-shift-debug、simple-mode、hide-sidebar-tooltip、hide-trajectory-tab、hide-chat-tab 六条 tweak。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/MeganeOnly/meganeonly-dsh-plugins.git",
    "directory": "dsh-ui-tweaks"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/MeganeOnly/meganeonly-dsh-plugins/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/MeganeOnly/meganeonly-dsh-plugins/tree/main/dsh-ui-tweaks#readme",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "ui",
    "css",
    "appearance",
    "customization"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "scripts": {
    "build:client": "node lib/build-client.cjs",
    "verify:client": "node lib/verify-client.cjs",
    "prepare": "node lib/build-client.cjs"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "package.json"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
